{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/34818-demon-the-seinfelding","id":34818,"title":"Demon: The Seinfelding","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-21T23:07:23-08:00","id":34818,"title":"Demon: The Seinfelding","content":"So after some thinking on the subject, I have this idea for a Ring of four Demons. One of them, a Messenger Inquisitor, has a cover as a stand-up comic. The second, a Destroyer Tempter, doesn't really look at his Cover as a job, instead seeing the idea as &quot;horrible excuse for a human being&quot;. The third has the only female Cover of the group; a Messenger Tempter, she views herself as being born to be in the business of selling people things. The final one's cover is a bit shaky, which is surprising, given that he's a Psychopomp and they're supposed to be all over that. He's an Integrator, which may explain why he's become friends with the Cover of the Hunter Angel sent to re-assimilate them: a postal worker who has, for reasons that are a bit hard to explain, a vendetta against our Inquisitor.<br /> <br /> Thoughts? Comments? Concerns?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;Seven deadly sins/Seven ways to win/Seven holy paths to hell/And your trip begins/Seven downward slopes/Seven bloodied hopes/Seven are your burning fires/Seven your desires&quot; \u2014 Iron Maiden,</i> Moonchild","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1122-the-grim-lich","name":"The Grim Lich","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}